{title: This Is My Song}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
This [C]is my [F]song[**], oh [G]God of [**]all the [C]nations[**][**]
A [C]song of [F]Peace[**] for [G]lands a[**]far and [C]mine[**][**]
